SUMMARY:Final Month - Sonic Journey Through Sound
DESCRIPTION:Inner Peace Collective\nSomatic Sounds is moving to South FL i
 n Dec. This will be the final month for sessions.\n**I want to Thank Ashev
 ille for all the support!**\n\n[Every Weekend @ 11am & 3pm](https://somati
 csounds.net/events/)\n**\\* $26 to reserve please use the event link** (li
 mited capacity)\n[https://somaticsounds.net/events/](https://somaticsounds
 .net/events/)\n\nSonic Journey Through Sound\nCome experience a somatic jo
 urney where ancient wisdom meets modern well-being — a multidimensional 
 soundscape\, richer and more textured than a traditional sound bath. Vivek
  guides each session with over 40 handcrafted singing bowls\, layered with
  binaural beats to support deep relaxation and nervous system regulation. 
 Participants leave feeling settled in the body and quiet in the mind.\n\nY
 oga mats\, pillows\, and blankets are provided.\n\nThis event is open to a
 ll levels—whether you’re a seasoned mindfulness enthusiast\, exploring
  a novel path to relaxation\, or simply seeking stress relief.\n\n\\*\\* $
 26 to Reserve a spot please use Event Link or Contact Vivek\n**[Every Week
 end @ 11am & 3pm](https://somaticsounds.net/events/)**\n\n#soundhealing #s
 oundbath #meditation
