SUMMARY:Sound Healing: The Final Month in Asheville
DESCRIPTION:Inner Peace Collective\nNovember is the final month of session
 s here in Asheville before I move to South Florida. If you've been meaning
  to come\, or want one more journey together\, now is the time.\n\nI want 
 to Thank Asheville for all the support!\n\n**Start Your Work Week with a S
 ound Meditation:**\n[Every Weekend ](https://somaticsounds.net/events/)Ses
 sions @ 11am\, 3pm\, 6pm\n**\\* $26 to reserve please use the event link**
  (limited capacity)\n[https://somaticsounds.net/events/](https://somaticso
 unds.net/events/)\n\nCome immerse yourself in a somatic journey of sound a
 nd relaxation\, where ancient wisdom meets modern well‑being. The soothi
 ng tones of Himalayan singing bowls wash over you\, calming the mind and r
 enewing the spirit.\n\nFacilitated by Vivek\, this sound journey features 
 over 40 handcrafted singing bowls\, each rich with deeply somatic frequenc
 ies and overtones. Binaural beats are layered in to support deeper relaxat
 ion\, meditation\, and nervous system regulation. Together they create a s
 oundscape that goes far beyond a traditional sound bath\, inviting clarity
 \, release\, and inner spaciousness.\n\nOpen to all levels\, whether you'r
 e new to this or have been practicing for years.\n\n\\*\\* $26 to Reserve 
 a spot please use Event Link (limited capacity)\n**[Every Weekend @ 11am &
  6pm](https://somaticsounds.net/events/)**\nOr\n**[Contact Vivek](https://
 somaticsounds.net/contact/)**\n\n#soundhealing #soundbath #meditation
